# EZPay API — env documentation
#
# ⚠️ This app does NOT need its own .env file.
# All runtime config comes from the ROOT monorepo file:
#   @ezstart/.env.local / .env.staging / .env.production
#
# See /SECRETS.md for the canonical architecture.
#
# Variables consumed by this API (from root):
#   - MONGO_URL                  → used via getMongoUrl('ezpay')
#   - JWT_SECRET                 → used via getJwtSecret()
#   - STRIPE_SECRET_KEY          → Stripe server-side
#   - STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET      → Stripe webhook signature verification
#   - STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY     → sent to web for Stripe.js init
#   - RESEND_API_KEY             → payment receipts
#   - SENTRY_DSN_EZPAY           → resolved via getSentryDsn('ezpay')
